      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. To make it even more impactful, can you add a section that specifically addresses the people who stay home? I want to drive home the idea that choosing not to vote isn't just a personal choice, but a form of negligence or even a betrayal of the social contract. How can we frame their absence as a moral failing rather than just a different way of engaging?",
